hyperMAC's own changes to IronRDP, applied after ironrdp-keel.patch (tools/vendor-ironrdp.sh).

- ironrdp-server: a redraw the client asks for (RefreshRectangle; the display_refresh counter)
  makes the encoder forget its copy of the client's picture, so the next bitmap is sent whole.
  Without it a part the client lost stayed lost while the picture did not change there
  (kRDPclient on a VM whose screen was still: black but for the tiles that moved).

